  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start Ready Risk Pool 5 - Drought Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- To protect the agricultural and pastoral livelihoods and access to water of vulnerable households through the distribution of suitable seeds, support for pastoralist households, support for strategic water points and technical advice, in order to limit production losses, preserve livestock and maintain access to water in the most vulnerable areas.2-To safeguard household food security through pre-emptive cash transfers designed to maintain purchasing power, meet essential food needs and limit the use of negative coping strategies.3-Prevent the deterioration of the nutritional status of children under five, as well as pregnant and breastfeeding women, through early community screening, referral to health facilities, strengthening nutritional care and promoting good dietary and nutritional practices.</narrative>
  </description>
